      <td style="padding-top:0.01in;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><h2 style="font-size:9pt;margin-top:5.65pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#005496;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Adj. operating income and margin*</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">: Operating income adjusted for capacity alignments, antitrust related matters and for FY 2023 the Andrews litigation settlement. Capacity alignments include non-recurring costs related to our structural efficiency and business cycle management programs.</font></h2><h2 style="font-size:9pt;margin-top:5.65pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#005496;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Capex, net:</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> Capital Expenditure, net, defined as Expenditures for Property, Plant and Equipment less Proceeds from sale of Property, Plant and Equipment.</font></h2></td>
